[SPEAKER_01]: Not make it into another thing and say, no, that's also not my eye, because then your mind will peripherally assume something else is.

256
00:19:40,162 --> 00:19:42,963
[SPEAKER_01]: Which means, when I say peripheral, it means like a negative thought.

257
00:19:43,043 --> 00:19:46,524
[SPEAKER_01]: It's not, it doesn't, doesn't become a positive center of your attention.

258
00:19:47,204 --> 00:19:54,926
[SPEAKER_01]: And you need to see it as such, as a negative thought, not to make it a positive center of attention, because then something else would be a negative thought in regard to that.

