[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

371
00:26:36,659 --> 00:26:37,179
[SPEAKER_01]: Don't do that.

372
00:26:37,319 --> 00:26:37,579
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

373
00:26:37,919 --> 00:26:38,120
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

374
00:26:38,160 --> 00:26:45,164
[SPEAKER_00]: But you can still, in a sense, know that there can only be things because there is consciousness.

375
00:26:45,744 --> 00:26:46,024
[SPEAKER_01]: Yeah.

376
00:26:46,064 --> 00:26:47,025
