1210
01:17:29,746 --> 01:17:34,448
[SPEAKER_01]: Then, already, if he keeps pursuing that instruction, he becomes like a dhamminusāri or sādhanusāri.

1211
01:17:34,988 --> 01:17:37,930
[SPEAKER_01]: So, he's not yet sotāpanna, but he's kind of already attained to the right view.

1212
01:17:37,990 --> 01:17:39,430
[SPEAKER_01]: He already developed the criteria.

1213
01:17:40,271 --> 01:17:42,612
[SPEAKER_01]: And if he carries on, he will reach, become sotāpanna.

1214
01:17:44,397 --> 01:17:46,998
[SPEAKER_01]: So, you can't even forget about sotāpanna, sakadāgāmī, whatever.

1215
01:17:47,198 --> 01:17:54,141
