[SPEAKER_01]: There's nothing special about any experience at all.

1331
01:23:50,022 --> 01:23:53,625
[SPEAKER_01]: When there's only one special experience, that's when you abandon all the experience.

1332
01:23:54,626 --> 01:23:57,489
[SPEAKER_01]: And that's not the experience that you can just have.

1333
